# darksamus_uevent.py's driver (25 frames apart). `uevent <id> <type> <dt>`: the dt is the key; each
# line starts with the save (130) and ends with the put-back (199), both on DamageOff (9), which
# returns at once. Types: 0 Projectile, 8 DamageOn, 12 Landing, 14 FadeIn, 15 FadeOut, 16
# ScreenShake, 18 EndAction, 19 BecomeRagDoll, 27 EventStart, 28 EventStop, 33 EffectOn, 34
# EffectOff, 37, 38, 43, 46, 3 (a type the switch leaves to the base).
@f600 send u04f7 Activate; god 1
@f625 uevent u04f7 9 130; trigcall u04f7 BreakNormalMissile; trigcall u04f7 BreakSuperMissile; trigcall u04f7 BreakFreezeBeam; uevent u04f7 12 105; trigcall u04f7 BreakNormalMissile; uevent u04f7 12 107; trigcall u04f7 BreakSuperMissile; uevent u04f7 12 109; trigcall u04f7 BreakFreezeBeam; uevent u04f7 12 119; uevent u04f7 9 199; trigcall u04f7 BreakFreezeBeam
